%N A398033 Number of rooted unlabeled 5-gonal cacti having n blocks.
%H A398033 Frederic G. Speyser, <a href="https://github.com/frederic-speyser/non-plane-mgonal-cacti">mgonal_cactus_series.py</a>
%F A398033 G.f. s(x) satisfies s(x) = x + x*(exp(Sum_{i>=1} K_C(x^i)/i) - 1), with K_C(x) = (1/2)*(s(x)^(m-1) + s(x^2)^((m-1)/2)) for m=5. The critical value is tau_5 = (2/4)^(1/4) = 2^(-1/4) (closed form). The radius of convergence rho_5 itself has no known closed form.
%o A398033 (Python) # See Links
%o A398033 (PARI)
%o A398033 EulerT(v)={Vec(exp(x*Ser(dirmul(v, vector(#v, n, 1/n))))-1, -#v)}
%o A398033 seq(n)={my(v=[]); for(n=1, n, my(g=1+x*Ser(v)); v=EulerT(Vec((g^4 + subst(g^2, x, x^2))/2))); concat([1], v)} \\ _Andrew Howroyd_, Jul 17 2026
